      "description": "A five-stage qualification process for introducing a second ADC12 supplier alongside incumbent supply, from paperwork review through parallel running to contract volume.",
      "totalTime": "P8W",
      "step": [
        {"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"Review the paperwork before the metal","text":"Request a recent material test certificate, the CBAM emissions data, the ISO 9001 certificate and a full composition report including elements outside the EN AC-46000 list. Check the iron target and ask for the heat-to-heat spread rather than the specification limit."},
        {"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"Order a trial quantity","text":"Order 5 to 10 tonnes rather than a full 20 tonne container. This is enough for one or two production shifts on a representative tool without committing to contract volume."},
